{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10294110","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10294110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1029411001:0":{"text":"어라? 저기 블랙골드 상인이... 울고 있는 거 같은데요?","source_cn":"诶？那个黑金的人……在哭？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86519038D772BE6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1029411002:0":{"text":"잠깐만요, 페이 탐정이 추리를 해보겠어요! 현장의 상태로 보아...","source_cn":"等等，根据现场的状况，让菲侦探推理一番——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10CF642D93B49DFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029411003:0":{"text":"그는 동료에게 따돌림당한 게 분명해요. 다른 사람들은 다 떠났는데, 저 사람만 여기 혼자 남아 있으니까요!","source_cn":"她一定是被同伴排挤了，因为他们都撤离了，把她一个人丢在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D466D0FAAA121A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:菲":{"text":"페이","source":"菲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}